Individual vendored source files retain their original NVIDIA
Apache-2.0 SPDX headers where copied with only import-path adaptations
(src/coastdiff/models/vendor/*.py).

The checkpoints bundled in checkpoints/regression/ and checkpoints/diffusion/
are model weights trained using the NVIDIA PhysicsNeMo CorrDiff training
pipeline (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) on HRRR data from NOAA's Global Systems
Laboratory.
